  "contract": [
    "#4247 and #7566: Weakening Venom (805778) and Nullifying Venom (805777) ship StackAmount 2, so a recast while",
    "active added a second stack that the client tooltip renders as a larger value. The maintainer decided they must",
    "not stack: a recast refreshes the venom and leaves one stack, like the other four venoms. The recast stays",
    "allowed at the two-unique-venom cap, a third unique venom is still refused (SPELL_FAILED_CANT_DO_THAT_RIGHT_NOW",
    "173), Venomizer still adds 10 to their proc chance and both still proc their payloads (706000, 805897) from",
    "Venom Bolt. Sixteen bolts at 45% and 40% leave under 0.03% chance of a false missing proc."
  ],
